  "desc": "Speech and spoken digits shattered into granular braindance: chop() dices each word, ply() ratchets it into stutter bursts, and light crush/coarse bit-dice the grain before shape() reclaims the level. chunk and iter walk the shards while a saw pump ducks the on-beat onsets. Autechre-ish, intricate, restless.",
